          smul_dotProduct, dotProduct_smul, smul_eq_mul, smul_eq_mul, smul_eq_mul]
      -- goal: ‖v‖⁻¹ * (‖v‖⁻¹ * (vᵀAv + s*(vᵀNv))) < 0
      ...
```
